# Build output. The binary is named after the module by `go build ./...`, and the
# menu-bar and cross-compiled variants land in dist/.
dist/
relay-client
pagecrawl-relay
pagecrawl-relay-menubar
built

# Local credentials and optional browser-test dependencies.
.env
.pagecrawl-relay/
node_modules/

# The Android library is built from source by mobile/build-aar.sh, never committed.
*.aar
*-sources.jar

# The Android relay app: Gradle output and local SDK paths never belong in the repository.
android/.gradle/
android/.kotlin/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/local.properties
android/*.jks
android/*.keystore

# Signing material. The Apple Developer ID certificate, the notary API key and the
# Android keystore live outside the repository (iCloud) and reach CI only as
# repository secrets. These patterns stop a copy dropped here from being committed,
# and this monorepo autocommits.
*.p12
*.pfx
*.p8
*.pem
*.key
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.keychain
*.keychain-db
*.jks
*.keystore
*.b64
AuthKey_*
*password*.txt
